 "words": 233,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "What did you go to the wild to see",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A reed shaken by the passing wind",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Or a man in soft and costly clothes",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Those who wear such splendor dwell in palaces",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But what did you go there to find",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A prophet, yes, and far more than that",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Behold, I send my messenger ahead",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who will prepare your way before you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "No one born of women is greater than John",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet the least in the kingdom is greater than he",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "This generation is like children in the square",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Calling out to one another in vain",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They sat in the marketplace calling out",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We played the flute and you did not dance",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We sang a dirge and you did not weep",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "John came eating no bread or wine",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You said he has a demon within",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The Son of Man came eating and drinking",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You said a glutton and a drunkard",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A friend of tax collectors and sinners",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "No one born of women is greater than John",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet the least in the kingdom is greater than he",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "This generation is like children in the square",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Calling out to one another in vain",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tax collectors acknowledged God's justice there",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For they were baptized with John's baptism",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Pharisees rejected God's purpose for themselves",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Since they had not been baptized by him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet wisdom is vindicated by all her children",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Wisdom is vindicated by all her children",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
